Topic 1: find() & findOne()
Q1. Show all employees.
db.employees.find();

Concept: Return all documents.

Q2. Show only one employee.
db.employees.findOne();

Concept: Return the first matching document.

Q3. Find the employee named "tayyab".
db.employees.find({
    name: "tayyab"
});

Concept: Equality match.

Q4. Find all married employees.
db.employees.find({
    isMarried: true
});

Concept: Boolean filtering.

Q5. Find employees living in Lahore.
db.employees.find({
    "address.city": "lhr"
});

Concept: Dot notation (Nested documents).

