Problem 5 (Interview Question - Pagination)
Question

Assume:

Page Size = 5
Show Page 3
Sort employees by salary (highest first)
Logic

Pagination Formula

skip = (page - 1) × limit

For Page 3

skip = (3 - 1) × 5

skip = 10
Solution
db.employees.find()
.sort({
    salary:-1
})
.skip(10)
.limit(5);
